Gp-z5XqB8d32AxfNZDzBBbAANkyQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFYgYJg-9NFsguS96oqfWhU22qtp6eA5SLg59RfBBDnSQ&oe=6A85865E"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "1355250863168631", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307309_1355250866501964_2756353681174667794_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I_Trnv6PEtEQ7kNvwE-e4jO&_nc_oc=AdqBmjerH51mzBgLu7CNd_ClHq0LOvlrf6Zszdaz28IlNUmOT0TKjRuzJOnt7dxhj-E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHXpV8XtLNkDpMb3S-e0FYaQYX5a1_dQWNv06AFD0U9wQ&oe=6A85AAE9"}, {"file_name": "01.png", "id": "2379160409234343", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314648_2379160412567676_6934786071623767694_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eU6MQUCAwaEQ7kNvwGoYR0x&_nc_oc=Adq4K5HMoCdtFMvmSzeZ507lTV6FvaPpCuf7acvAbYUWtiWydddGFOC_R5kis5Li0I4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFlDjknicxfdA2FBlQRyzrMF_dn4j_50WgLqGkExsnweQ&oe=6A857EEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape_Cover.png", "id": "4011976365767233", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/618758916_4011976369100566_7485671115037897259_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aoBRm5btlFkQ7kNvwGTUmSj&_nc_oc=AdoQtLTKNnby96ysBbNkDUJL8R5oZWeLFYIE5-8uM9ljeagZwZHnuB0woJcEME9ojdw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGL7AQstQN7OTWIfpOaqjQohsYUha7Iqg-iOZN4Az5I_g&oe=6A85AF2E"}, "display_name": "Neon Chuck", "keywords": ["rhythm", "fitness", "action", "synthwave", "arcade"], "long_description": "# Feel the Flow. Master the Chain.\n\n**Neon Chuck** is a VR rhythm-action experience where physical momentum meets high-energy music. Forget abstract timing. Here, your movement carries weight. Swing custom, physics-driven nunchucks (nunchaku) to shatter incoming targets and turn every impact into a stylish display of kinetic power.\n\n# Core Features\n\n- **Weighted Physics Combat**: Feel the drag, momentum, and impact with custom chain simulation. Your physical swing power directly drives the Kinetic Scoring system, every hit feels real.\n- **Trick Shots & Chain Reactions**: Launch shattered targets as projectiles to trigger massive score bonuses and visually explosive combos.\npersonalized swing.\n- **Play Your Way**: Full support for Standing, Seated, and Lay-Down play styles, ensuring maximum comfort for any setup.\n\n# Immerse Yourself in the Neon\n\n- **Audio-Reactive Environment**: Flow through handcrafted beat patterns inside a pulsing, sci-fi hex-tunnel, all controlled by a sleek, transparent black glass UI.\n- **Original Soundtrack**: Master bundled tracks, featuring high-energy hits like \"Velocity Point\", \"The Calculated Move\", and \"Sunday Morning High Score\".\n\n**Unleash the Neon. Master the Chucks.**", "short_description": "Unleash your kinetic power in the ultimate VR chain-weapon rhythm experience!\n\n\u2022 Feel the weighted momentum of custom physics-driven neon weapons.\n\u2022 Strike and launch targets to trigger visually explosive trick-shot chain reactions.\n\u2022 Flow through high-energy original tracks inside an audio-reactive sci-fi world.\n\u2022 Choose your play style: Campaign, Free Play.\n\nMaster the chain, find your flow, and become the ultimate Neon Chuck master."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://rovingames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://rovingames.com/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Rovin Games", "support_website_url": "https://rovingames.com/support/", "website_url": "https://rovingames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genr